 (307,'Cenkl–Porter1984','Section4 p.44 assumes a simplicial complex of finite type with cubical subdivision. Theorem4.1 gives all-degree cohomology for q≥1 with coefficients Q_q=Z[1/p: p prime≤q]; Theorem4.2 p.46 respects products across the sum of weights.','The original p.35 and44 were visually checked: both inequalities are inclusive. Weight changes the coefficient ring; no ordinary integral CDGA comparison is inferred.'),
 (308,'Mandell2001 coefficients and finite type','The author version Main Theorem p.1 gives a full contravariant embedding for connected p-complete nilpotent finite p-type spaces into E∞ algebras over Fp-bar. AppendixA ThA.1 p.35 distinguishes fields; over a finite field ThA.2 has free-loop-space maps.','The algebraic closure cannot be replaced silently by Fp. This is distinct from Mandell2006 integral cochain classification.'),
