 (310,'Richter–Sagave2020 diagram model','Theorem1.1 p.1719 uses commutative I-diagram algebras, I finite sets and injections, with Day convolution; their homotopy colimit models singular cochains as E∞ algebras over a commutative ring. Theorem1.2 classifies nilpotent finite-type spaces overZ.','Strict commutativity belongs to a diagram category. Section1.4 p.1722 retains the failure of fullness of the homotopy functor.'),
